  "notes": [
    "Published variants show enabled default size. The linked specimen board demonstrates small, default, large, and disabled runtime states.",
    "Status colors bind existing light and dark semantic tokens. Pending uses color.marker.orange as its orange hue; the StatusIcon API owns the pending meaning.",
    "All clock-mono and circle-mono strokes bind color.text in both themes, regardless of status. Use adjacent visible text to distinguish these states.",
    "The glossy LED adds a fixed white highlight over a token-bound color. The progressing clock uses a local dark hand in Penpot because color.warning-foreground becomes yellow in the dark theme; Angular uses the dark canvas color for contrast."
  ]
